    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story and background:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Exia, a test subject of the School of Bio-Engineering of Cyan College, who gained special power through the mysterious [serum]. In order to escape from the college under lockdown and save as many survivers as possible, she must fight her way through this cruel world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything comes with a price. Defeat enemies, talk to NPCs, explore areas, and finally uncover the truth of [serum] that, claimed by the scientists of Cyan College, could end pain, disease and sadness of all mankind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794870/extras/7ebcdf5387d3cb3ce948147ae71aa9d0.poster.avif?t=1750054627\" width=500 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794870/extras/7ebcdf5387d3cb3ce948147ae71aa9d0.webm?t=1750054627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794870/extras/7ebcdf5387d3cb3ce948147ae71aa9d0.mp4?t=1750054627\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hack and Slash + Souls-Like Combat:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deflect, slash, dodge, skills, use your moveset wisely to defeat various challenging foes. Build your own playstyle as you acquire more unique weapons, items and abilities along the journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794870/extras/0de1ea4478f6ea0d266d78bc451c2369.poster.avif?t=1750054627\" width=500 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794870/extras/0de1ea4478f6ea0d266d78bc451c2369.webm?t=1750054627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794870/extras/0de1ea4478f6ea0d266d78bc451c2369.mp4?t=1750054627\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Non-linear world and handcrafted levels:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unearth the conspiracy behind the outbreak as you venture through a nonlinear world set in a biohazard background. Fight against mutated creatures and malfunctioned androids that used to protect the Cyan College. Search for the remedy that could save the infected.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794870/extras/9d5bb2e6f093898b7750232888617957.poster.avif?t=1750054627\" width=512 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794870/extras/9d5bb2e6f093898b7750232888617957.webm?t=1750054627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794870/extras/9d5bb2e6f093898b7750232888617957.mp4?t=1750054627\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[h5][/h5]</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story and background:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Exia, a test subject of the School of Bio-Engineering of Cyan College, who gained special power through the mysterious [serum]. In order to escape from the college under lockdown and save as many survivers as possible, she must fight her way through this cruel world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything comes with a price. Defeat enemies, talk to NPCs, explore areas, and finally uncover the truth of [serum] that, claimed by the scientists of Cyan College, could end pain, disease and sadness of all mankind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794870/extras/7ebcdf5387d3cb3ce948147ae71aa9d0.poster.avif?t=1750054627\" width=500 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794870/extras/7ebcdf5387d3cb3ce948147ae71aa9d0.webm?t=1750054627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794870/extras/7ebcdf5387d3cb3ce948147ae71aa9d0.mp4?t=1750054627\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hack and Slash + Souls-Like Combat:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deflect, slash, dodge, skills, use your moveset wisely to defeat various challenging foes. Build your own playstyle as you acquire more unique weapons, items and abilities along the journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794870/extras/0de1ea4478f6ea0d266d78bc451c2369.poster.avif?t=1750054627\" width=500 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794870/extras/0de1ea4478f6ea0d266d78bc451c2369.webm?t=1750054627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794870/extras/0de1ea4478f6ea0d266d78bc451c2369.mp4?t=1750054627\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Non-linear world and handcrafted levels:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unearth the conspiracy behind the outbreak as you venture through a nonlinear world set in a biohazard background. Fight against mutated creatures and malfunctioned androids that used to protect the Cyan College. Search for the remedy that could save the infected.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794870/extras/9d5bb2e6f093898b7750232888617957.poster.avif?t=1750054627\" width=512 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794870/extras/9d5bb2e6f093898b7750232888617957.webm?t=1750054627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794870/extras/9d5bb2e6f093898b7750232888617957.mp4?t=1750054627\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[h5][/h5]</p>",
    "short_description": "Cyan Breach is a Metriodivania game set in a biohazard background. The combat style integrates traditional 2D hack and slash with souls-like elements. Explore the game world, gain new skills and weapons, increase character's power, and finally reveal the conspiracy that caused the apocalypse.",
